{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":12,"ref":"haggai 2:12","book":"haggai","lang":"de","chapter":2,"translation":"Siehe, ⟨wenn⟩ jemand heiliges Fleisch im Saum seines Gewandes trägt und mit seinem Saum ⟨an⟩ das Brot ⟨stößt⟩ und ⟨an⟩ das Gericht und ⟨an⟩ den Wein und ⟨an⟩ das Öl und ⟨an⟩ jede Speise — wird ⟨es⟩ heilig ⟨geweiht⟩? Und die Kohen antworteten und sagten: Nein.","tokens":[{"surface":"הן","gloss":"Siehe"},{"surface":"ישא","gloss":"⟨wenn⟩ … trägt"},{"surface":"איש","gloss":"jemand"},{"surface":"בשר","gloss":"Fleisch"},{"surface":"קדש","gloss":"heiliges"},{"surface":"בכנף","gloss":"im Saum"},{"surface":"בגדו","gloss":"seines Gewandes"},{"surface":"ונגע","gloss":"und … ⟨stößt⟩"},{"surface":"בכנפו","gloss":"mit seinem Saum"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"⟨an⟩"},{"surface":"הלחם","gloss":"das Brot"},{"surface":"ואל","gloss":"und ⟨an⟩"},{"surface":"הנזיד","gloss":"das Gericht"},{"surface":"ואל","gloss":"und ⟨an⟩"},{"surface":"היין","gloss":"den Wein"},{"surface":"ואל","gloss":"und ⟨an⟩"},{"surface":"שמן","gloss":"das Öl"},{"surface":"ואל","gloss":"und ⟨an⟩"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"jede"},{"surface":"מאכל","gloss":"Speise"},{"surface":"היקדש","gloss":"wird ⟨es⟩ heilig ⟨geweiht⟩"},{"surface":"ויענו","gloss":"Und … antworteten"},{"surface":"הכהנים","gloss":"die Kohen"},{"surface":"ויאמרו","gloss":"und sagten"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"Nein"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T10:27:26.399200265Z","model":"glm-5.2"}